{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14145","headline":"辰州闻大驾还宫 · 戎昱","name":"辰州闻大驾还宫","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闻道銮舆归魏阙，望云西拜喜成悲。\n宁知陇水烟销日，再有园林秋荐时。\n渭水战添亡虏血，秦人生覩旧朝仪。\n自惭出守辰州畔，不得亲随日月旗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"戎昱","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14145.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14145","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}